[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Shopping Made Easy]
[00:12.97]Who was the thief?
[00:17.14]People are not so honest as they once were.
[00:21.44]The temptation to steal is greater than ever before especially in large shops.
[00:29.15]A detective recently watched a well-dressed woman who always went into a large store on Monday mornings.
[00:38.36]One Monday,
[00:39.97]there were fewer people in the shop than usual when the woman came in,
[00:45.22]so it was easier for the detective to watch her.
[00:50.33]The woman first bought a few small articles.
[00:55.08]After a little time, she chose one of the most expensive dresses in the shop
[01:01.78]and handed it to an assistant who wrapped it up for her as quickly as possible.
[01:08.99]Then the woman simply took the parcel and walked out of the shop without paying.
[01:16.63]When she was arrested,
[01:18.96]the detective found out that the shop assistant was her daughter.
[01:24.74]The girl 'gave' her mother a free dress once a week!
